msgstr ""

#: includes/class-export-prompt.php:363
msgid "In the first table, Metric names the figure and the next column holds its value for the period. The last two columns, including Change (%), are empty because there is no comparison period."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-export-prompt.php:365
msgid "In the second table, Period is the date or time of the row. Previous period is the matching date in the comparison period, and the columns ending in \"(previous period)\" hold its figures."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-export-prompt.php:366
msgid "In the second table, Period is the date or time of the row."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-export-prompt.php:371
msgid "Goal is the name of the goal. Type is page (reached by viewing a page) or event (reached by an event such as a form submission)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-export-prompt.php:372
msgid "Match and Value are the rule of the goal: Match is equals, contains, starts, ends or regex, and Value is the page path or event name it is compared with."
