#: includes/class-export-prompt.php:402
msgid "Visitor ID (anonymous) is the same for pageviews from the same visitor."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-export-prompt.php:403
msgid "Time is when the page was opened. Page path and Page title identify the page, and Content type is its WordPress post type."
