#: includes/class-export-prompt.php:406
msgid "New visitor, Country, Region, City, Device, Browser, OS, Channel, Source, Referrer, UTM source, UTM medium and UTM campaign repeat the values of the visit."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-export-prompt.php:410
msgid "Event ID is the number of the event. Session ID links it to its visit in the raw visits export, and Visitor ID (anonymous) is the same for events from the same visitor."
msgstr ""

